  "prefLabel": "Plc 1402.06 NCTRC knowledge domain",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1402.06 “NCTRC knowledge domain” means any of the NCTRC professional knowledge domains listed in the NCTRC’s “Job Analysis Report / Report on the International Job Analysis of Certified Therapeutic Recreation Specialists”, available via the NCTRC’s website at https://nctrc.org/wp-content/uploads/2021JobAnalysisReport.pdf, which follows a title page labeled “2021 CTRS® Job Analysis Study”.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Plc 1400) #13705, eff 8-1-23; ss by #14442 (formerly Plc 1402.17), eff 1-26-26, EXPIRES 1-26-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1400.html"
